{"synopsis":"Pernah ada sebuah regu yang berusaha untuk mengalahkan Raja Iblis dan menyelamatkan dunia, Regu Pahlawan.\n\nNamun, karena lelah dengan keengganan Regu Pahlawan untuk langsung mengalahkan Raja Iblis, sang Penyihir Abu Raniel keluar dari Regu Pahlawan dan kembali ke kampung halamannya untuk bertemu dengan Master-nya.\n\nDi sana, ia direkomendasikan sebuah posisi sebagai asisten profesor di sebuah akademi bergengsi.\n\n“Kenapa kamu begitu buruk dalam hal ini? Tinggal buat circuit sihir, selimuti dirimu dengan mana, dan gunakan.”\n\nNamun, seorang jenius seperti dia tampaknya tidak memiliki bakat untuk mengajar orang lain…\n\nManusia terkuat memulai pekerjaan barunya yang riuh di akademi sihir!","alternative_title":"용사 파티 때려치웁니다","author":"GRAPHICTORY, NariaTa","artist":"Lono","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"c2820f86-ccde-4401-8986-ffe0974e8de7","number":"139","chapter":"139","title":"Chapter 139","date":"2026-05-11","released":"2026-05-11","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"89c77e14-cb93-4578-a967-11d88959aa43","number":"138","chapter":"138","title":"Chapter 138","date":"2026-04-29","released":"2026-04-29","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"0dac90a4-00be-4cb0-821a-9699e8e4871f","number":"137","chapter":"137","title":"Chapter 137","date":"2026-04-17","released":"2026-04-17","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"6cce1096-5bb3-4b97-bbe8-8dc70832bbe0","number":"136","chapter":"136","title":"Chapter 136","date":"2026-04-02","released":"2026-04-02","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"7e35cd5c-4d94-4e48-aebf-57439dfdf8d5","number":"135","chapter":"135","title":"Chapter 135","date":"2026-03-06","released":"2026-03-06","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"44c36a0e-dbbb-4cfc-a971-982d60e42484","number":"134","chapter":"134","title":"Chapter 134","date":"2026-03-06","released":"2026-03-06","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"45111b9d-1f4f-46de-b644-588b89995af4","number":"133","chapter":"133","title":"Chapter 133","date":"2026-02-22","released":"2026-02-22","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"5c86386f-f668-499c-8aae-c4ab1f9175